        <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">Supply of high-performance AI servers for the Cyprus Institute HPC Facility, CyI/HPCF/EdgeAI/DiGiNN/2025</cbc:Name>
        <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The object of the contract concerns the procurement, delivery, installation, and commissioning of two (2) high-performance AI servers equipped with NVIDIA B200 GPUs, alongside their peripherals (Lot 1), and six (6) to twelve (12) high-performance servers equipped with NVIDIA RTX 6000 PRO GPUs (Lot 2). Together, these systems will form the foundation of the Cyprus Edge-AI Hub, designed to support state-of-the-art research and innovation in Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and High-Performance Data Analytics.</cbc:Description>
